+# Feature: createPatch(from, to)
+
+Produces an RFC 6902 JSON Patch that turns `from` into `to` via `applyPatch`.
+
+- Does not mutate inputs; equal documents give `[]`.
+- Minimal: only differing places appear (member add/remove/replace, recursion into objects and arrays).
+- Arrays are aligned on a longest common subsequence so inserts/removals do not rewrite the tail
+  (positional fallback for very large arrays).
+- Pointers are escaped per RFC 6901; differing types or scalars produce `replace`, at root `path: ""`.
